        // So instead, we must ensure the caller to settle is the same as who locked the guess. Therefore set actor==payee when possible.

        // If payee equals receiver (an EOA) but actor != receiver, then transfer will go to actor (the caller) — safe.
        // We need the caller who locked the guess to be the same as the transfer recipient to trigger the failing transfer case.
